Polaris-Win64-Shipping.exe+194958C: 74 09                 - je Polaris-Win64-Shipping.exe+1949597
Polaris-Win64-Shipping.exe+194958E: C7 47 2C 06 00 00 00  - mov [rdi+2C],00000006
